  "notes": "Taken here on the **abrasive/punk side only** — the gothic trap beats and harsh, swelling guitars. The documented construction is mid-tempo **guitar riffs written in minor key**, sampled or replayed, as the sole melodic instrument over 4-bar loops; the 808 doubles the guitar root an octave or two below with minimal glide, and that doubling is what makes the low end read as one fused instrument. \"Triple-time hi-hats\" against emo signifiers. ⚠ `medium`: the harmonic and instrumental construction, production roles and chart data are documented; the research rates it high-medium.",
